  "title": {
    "text": "More productive regions churn more, but London drives most of the link",
    "subtitle": [
      "ITL2 regions, 2018\u201323 pooled. Correlation r = 0.68 across all regions; 0.25 excluding London.",
      "Lines are linear fits. Productivity is current-price GVA per hour relative to the UK in the same year.",
      "Sources: ONS Longitudinal Business Database (Secure Access, SN 9501); ONS Subregional productivity (June 2025); authors' calculations."
    ]
  },
